{
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "A page is a list of elements, drawn one under the other by every client. This one has a table, two forms and a button; each reads or calls an endpoint of the plugin. The page needs the permission example.view; adding needs example.edit, deleting everything example.manage.",
      "textDe": "Eine Seite ist eine Liste von Elementen, die jeder Client untereinander zeichnet. Diese hat eine Tabelle, zwei Formulare und eine Schaltfläche; jedes liest oder ruft einen Endpunkt des Plugins auf. Die Seite braucht die Berechtigung example.view; Hinzufügen braucht example.edit, alles Löschen example.manage."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "label": "All notes",
      "labelDe": "Alle Notizen",
      "source": "notes",
      "text": "No notes yet.",
      "textDe": "Noch keine Notizen.",
      "columns": [
        { "key": "id", "label": "#", "labelDe": "Nr." },
        { "key": "title", "label": "Title", "labelDe": "Titel" },
        { "key": "category", "label": "Category", "labelDe": "Kategorie" },
        { "key": "priority", "label": "Priority", "labelDe": "Priorität" },
        { "key": "pinned", "label": "Pinned", "labelDe": "Angeheftet" },
        { "key": "created", "label": "Created", "labelDe": "Erstellt" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Add a note",
      "textDe": "Notiz hinzufügen"
    },
    {
      "type": "form",
      "label": "Add note",
      "labelDe": "Notiz hinzufügen",
      "action": { "method": "POST", "path": "notes/add" },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "field",
          "id": "title",
          "label": "Title",
          "labelDe": "Titel",
          "input": "text",
          "required": true,
          "maxLength": 100
        },
        {
          "type": "field",
          "id": "category",
          "label": "Category",
          "labelDe": "Kategorie",
          "input": "select",
          "default": "general",
          "options": [
            { "value": "general", "label": "General", "labelDe": "Allgemein" },
            { "value": "todo", "label": "To do", "labelDe": "Zu erledigen" },
            { "value": "idea", "label": "Idea", "labelDe": "Idee" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "field",
          "id": "priority",
          "label": "Priority (1 is urgent)",
          "labelDe": "Priorität (1 ist dringend)",
          "input": "number",
          "default": "3",
          "min": 1,
          "max": 5
        },
        {
          "type": "field",
          "id": "pinned",
          "label": "Pinned",
          "labelDe": "Angeheftet",
          "input": "checkbox"
        },
        {
          "type": "field",
          "id": "details",
          "label": "Details",
          "labelDe": "Einzelheiten",
          "input": "multiline",
          "maxLength": 500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Pin or unpin a note",
      "textDe": "Notiz anheften oder lösen"
    },
    {
      "type": "form",
      "label": "Pin or unpin",
      "labelDe": "Anheften oder lösen",
      "action": { "method": "PUT", "path": "notes/pin" },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The address of a button or form is fixed, so a form asks for the number of the note instead of having it in the address.",
          "textDe": "Die Adresse einer Schaltfläche oder eines Formulars steht fest; deshalb fragt ein Formular nach der Nummer der Notiz, statt sie in der Adresse zu haben."
        },
        {
          "type": "field",
          "id": "id",
          "label": "Number of the note",
          "labelDe": "Nummer der Notiz",
          "input": "number",
          "required": true,
          "min": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Delete all notes",
      "textDe": "Alle Notizen löschen"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Everybody who may open this page sees the button, but the endpoint needs example.manage: without it the call is refused. Hiding a page or a button is no protection.",
      "textDe": "Jeder, der diese Seite öffnen darf, sieht die Schaltfläche, aber der Endpunkt braucht example.manage: Ohne sie wird der Aufruf abgelehnt. Eine Seite oder Schaltfläche zu verstecken schützt nichts."
    },
    {
      "type": "button",
      "label": "Delete all notes",
      "labelDe": "Alle Notizen löschen",
      "action": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "path": "notes/clear",
        "confirm": "Really delete all notes?",
        "confirmDe": "Wirklich alle Notizen löschen?"
      }
    }
  ]
}
